        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AsynchronousMachineDynamics"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Asynchronous machine dynamics model used to describe dynamic behaviour of this asynchronous machine.</rdfs:comment>
