        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiagramObject"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AngleDegrees"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Sets the angle of rotation of the diagram object.  Zero degrees is pointing to the top of the diagram.  Rotation is clockwise.  DiagramObject.rotation0 has the following meaning The connection point of an element which has one terminal is pointing to the top side of the diagram. The connection point From side of an element which has more than one terminal is pointing to the top side of the diagram.DiagramObject.rotation90 has the following meaning The connection point of an element which has one terminal is pointing to the right hand side of the diagram. The connection point From side of an element which has more than one terminal is pointing to the right hand side of the diagram.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">rotation</rdfs:label>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


