        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Reactance"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Positive sequence series reactance of the transformer end.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment>Positive sequence series reactance starmodel of the transformer end.</rdfs:comment>
