        <rdfs:comment>Detection limit of related analog value if different from detection limit of test standard or if there is no test standard. The detection limit also known as lower limit of detection or limit of detection LOD is the lowest quantity of a substance that can be distinguished from the absence of that substance a blank value within a stated confidence limit generally 1.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">detectionLimit</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


