        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>The default method by which interchange schedules are to be integrated to obtain hourly MWh schedules for accounting. Method 1 is to integrate the instantaneous schedule between the hourly boundaries. Method 2 compensates for any updown ramping that occurs across the hourly boundary this is called block accounting.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">defaultIntegrationMethod</rdfs:label>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


