        <rdfs:comment>Simplified type UEL2 underexcitation limiter.  This model can be derived from UnderexcLimIEEE2.  The limit characteristic look up table is a single straightline the same as UnderexcLimIEEE2 see Figure 10.4 p 32 IEEE 421.52005 Section 10.2.</rdfs:comment>
