        <rdfs:comment>Equivalent Total Combustible Gas ETCG percent.An estimate calculated from the dissolvedgas concentrations and the oil sample temperature of what the TCG would be in a gas space in equilibrium with the oil. ETCG reflects what the TCG would be in air spaces near the oil.</rdfs:comment>
