        <rdfs:comment>This model separates the frequencydependent load primarily motors from other load.  ZIP2 equations for active and reactive power are used and the following attributes are requiredkp1 kp2 kp3 kq4 kpfkq1 kq2 kq3 kq4 kqf.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">zIP2</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


